For a week-long party of food, drink and dance. The fairgrounds take over a large thoroughfare a short walk from the harbour. Easily accessible by a nearby train line. At ten days enter through one of three ornate gold and white arches before blending into a large crowd moving between attractions. Traditional music emanating from the festival echoes down the surrounding blocks as dozens of marquees offer visitors an array of foreign delicacies, live performances, souvenirs and exhibitions.
大家聚在一起，享受为期一周的美食、美酒和舞蹈盛宴。游乐场占据了距离港口步行不远的一条宽敞大道，附近有铁路线，交通十分便利。为期十天的集市设有三个华丽的金白相间拱门，游客从其中一个拱门进入，便汇入了穿梭于各个游乐设施之间的人潮。节日中播放的传统音乐回荡在周围的街区，数十个大棚为游客提供各种异国美食、现场表演、纪念品和展览。

